  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmotherose.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1451856/description_919f659a-16de-4fdc-a793-bed5206de239.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"131\"></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⋆𐙚₊˚⊹♡ 🌿你好精靈與朋友們 🌷⋆౨ৎ</h3>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我經常被問到使用哪些模組，因此我決定為一個我常遊玩的模組世界打包一個模組包！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組包完全啟發於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmizunomcmemo.blogspot.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Minecraft 材質包</a></strong>，由於<strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fmizunos-16-craft%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始材質包</a> </strong>已有一段時間未更新，因此採用了玩家自製的擴充內容。我也加入了各種模組，涵蓋農業、世界生成以及其他我愛玩的便利性模組！☕</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">⛏️ 這個模組包是我個人正在使用的，風格溫馨舒適、簡單易上手，主要目的就是为了讓大家能再次使用大家最愛的 Mizuno 材質！୨୧ ₊˚๑</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我會持續更新這個模組包，只要發現新的 Mizuno 資源包就會加入！<br><em>這也是我第一次製作模組包，學習過程中還請多多包涵</em> 🌷</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>---------------------------------------<br></strong><strong>🌟<em> 部分收錄模組：</em>🌟<br></strong><strong>---------------------------------------</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/satisfy/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Various [Let's Do] Mods</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ribbits</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns &amp; Towers</a><br><br><strong>---------------------------------------------------<br></strong><strong>💗&nbsp;<em>部分收錄資源包：</em>💗<br>---------------------------------------------------<br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shorkbee's Mizuno Add-Ons</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modern-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coolbot's Modern Mizuno Add-On</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmizunos-tinker-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's | Tinker Edition</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur Ribbits and Farmer's Delight Resource Packs&nbsp;</a><br>(<em>我覺得 Excalibur 的一些小材質跟 Mizuno 很搭！</em>)<br><strong><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>備註：</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✨ 光影：</strong>BSL<br><strong>🌸 光影設定：</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f231WGAsC-C8%253fsi%253dZV9cqmP1IIm1NqKB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的光影設定！</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshockbyte.com%252fpartner%252fmotherose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1451856/description_19e940c3-d4fb-42bc-be52-ee36c46a9dc1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"52\" height=\"57\"></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshockbyte.com%252fpartner%252fmotherose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>你的 Minecraft 伺服器首月可享 25% 折扣！</strong></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em style=\"font-weight:400\">額外免責聲明</em><em><strong>：</strong></em><br><strong>‼️ 我不擁有任何模組或材質包 ‼️</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmotherose.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1451856/description_db275763-2575-471e-a9b5-72c2a8c3707e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></strong></a></p>",
